<title>USA: GTE gets $99.2 mln U.S. defense contract.</title>
<headline>GTE gets $99.2 mln U.S. defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Government Systems of Needham, Mass., a unit of GTE Corp, has received a $99.2 million U.S. defense contract for 18 months of logistics support, upgrades and expansions of telephone switching systems, the Air Force said.</p>
</text>
